    {
      "id": "claim_bab6a1688f1c46a58fd96b37334ee79a",
      "statement": "In the ALU immediate forms of OR, XOR, TBC and TBS the four-bit field is a bit index expanded to 1 << imm, and CLRB clears that bit; AND has no immediate form.",
